---
/**
 * SiteFooter — carried-over chrome. The brief specifies no footer, so this
 * holds only the sign-off, on the new tokens, until one is designed.
 *
 * The sign-off renders the legal entity as VIIS, LLC (d/b/a VIIS Partners)
 * until the Texas assumed-name filing completes, and the contact email
 * (brief §4). Both are also stated in the ProfessionalService graph in
 * Layout.astro, and structured data should only claim what the page shows.
 */
---

<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="container inner">
    <p class="t-mono fg-2">VIIS, LLC (d/b/a VIIS Partners) · Jadrin Garcia, Principal · San Antonio, Texas</p>
    <p class="t-mono fg-2"><a class="link" href="mailto:jgarcia@viispartners.com">jgarcia@viispartners.com</a></p>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .site-footer {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--hairline);
    padding-block: var(--sp-6);
  }

  .inner {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: var(--sp-2) var(--sp-5);
  }
</style>
